    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Proposed Architecture: To FULLY COVER all requirements, the firm's propose using the firm's Atelier platform with a Sovereign European open-weight model hosted by Faber IA on OuraneCloudusing ensures high availability, fast response times, and compliance with sovereignty and dependency requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For API integration, the firm's will utilize the firm's REST and webhook APIs to connect with the firm's existing information systems and user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure high performance and reliability, the platform will be deployed on Kubernetes for containerisation, allowing for efficient scaling and management of resources." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance (EU-only data hosting, no transfer outside EU, encryption and pseudonymisation of sensitive data where applicable), professional secrecy and confidentiality of client data, reliability and traceability of outputs, a complete audit trail, and explainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security controls do we need to implement to meet these requirements, specifically con24, con25, con26, con27, con28, con29, con30, con31, con32?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet these requirements, our company, Faber IA, already has several relevant security controls in place." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For GDPR compliance (con24, con25), we ensure that data is hosted within EU (con26) through we hosting partner OuraneCloud, which holds the SecNumCloud qualification at the hosting layer, supporting sovereign hosting of confidential data within EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This also inherently meets the requirement of not transferring data outside EU (con27)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For encryption and pseudonymisation of sensitive data (con28), we implement encryption in transit using TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest using AES-256." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assistance in drafting client letters and correspondence, mission notes, file memos and syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we utilize pseudonymisation where applicable." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure reliability and traceability of outputs (con29, con30), our product, Atelier, is designed to produce grounded and traceable figures or factual statements. designed means that every output can be traced back to every output source document, ensuring transparency and reliability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding the complete audit trail (con31) and explainability (con32), our product, Atelier supports internal quality control and statutory audit review, maintains an audit log of access and system outputs, and ensures that all information is grounded in sources with retrieval trace and figure source linking." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This provides a comprehensive audit trail and explains how outputs are generated, addressing the need for both a complete audit trail and explainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of specific security controls to implement beyond what we already have, it's essential to ensure that we data protection measures, such as strict partitioning of client files with logical isolation per client and mission, access controls preventing cross-client circulation of data, configurable retention aligned to legal archival obligations, Role-Based Access Control (RBAC), and audit logging, are fully operational and compliant with the specified constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given we existing certifications, including ISO 27001 for information security management and ISO 27701 for privacy information management, we have a solid foundation in place to meet these requirements. we experience with GDPR delivery, familiarity with professional secrecy, and awareness of anti-money laundering frameworks also support we ability to comply with the tender's demands." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, while we need to ensure seamless operation and continuous compliance with these requirements, we current security controls and certifications provide a robust basis for meeting the specified requirements, particularly those related to GDPR compliance, data protection, audit trails, and explainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance (EU-only data hosting, no transfer outside EU), professional secrecy and confidentiality of client data, reliability and traceability of outputs, a complete audit trail, explainability, respect of auditor independence, separation of duties, anti-money laundering obligations, and legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with these requirements, specifically con20, con21, con22, con33, con35, con36, con37? we have experience working with clients bound by professional secrecy, which suggests we can manage the confidentiality of client data as required. we company context indicates that we maintain administrative attestations available and up-to-date social and fiscal obligations, implying compliance with various regulatory requirements." ;
