    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we are familiar with GDPR (including Art. 28 processing agreements) as part of we monitored obligations, which suggests some level of awareness and adherence to GDPR principles." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For professional secrecy and confidentiality of client data (con20, con21, con22), we familiarity with contractual expectations of clients bound by professional secrecy implies we can respect these requirements. we also have experience with maintaining confidentiality undertakings in private consultation terms." ;
