    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Concerning reliability and traceability of outputs, completeness of the audit trail, explainability, and respect for auditor independence (con33, con35), Our company context does not provide direct information on reliability and traceability of outputs, completeness of the audit trail, explainability, and respect for auditor independence (con33, con35)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we experience with contractual agreements involving service levels, penalties, reversibility, audit rights, and confidentiality undertakings suggests we can negotiate and comply with such terms." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding separation of duties (con36) and anti-money laundering obligations (con37), we regulatory compliance includes monitoring auditor-independence and separation-of-duties rules for statutory audit, as well as the anti-money-laundering framework (LCB-FT). includes implies we are aware of separation of duties (con36) and anti-money laundering obligations (con37) and likely have mechanisms in place to respect separation of duties (con36) and anti-money laundering obligations (con37)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given this analysis, potential legal risks include ensuring strict GDPR compliance, particularly regarding data hosting and transfer, and demonstrating the reliability and traceability of we outputs, along with providing a complete audit trail and explainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "While we seem to be generally compliant with the mentioned constraints (con20, con21, con22, con33, con35, con36, con37) based on we experience and monitored obligations, explicit confirmation of EU-only data hosting and detailed explanations of we audit trails and output traceability mechanisms would strengthen we position." ;
