        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "During the handling and review of a client file, the solution must surface relevant information, recall applicable rules, propose a checklist of verifications and flag potential anomalies for human review (e.g. during the révision des comptes). the solution must support the preparation of recurring documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the firm's company context, the reference budget for this contract is €220,000 over 3 years, which fits within the firm's normal deal range and financial capacity. the firm's target gross margin percentage is between 25% and 35%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To determine the projected margin, the firm's need to consider the cost structure of this contract, which includes one-off project costs such as framing, design, integration, change management, and training, as well as recurring run costs like platform subscription, hosting/infrastructure, model-inference costs, support, and maintenance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The budget allocation is 40% for one-off project costs in the first year and 60% for recurring run costs over the three years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given that the firm's annual revenue is €6,200,000 and the firm's are near break-even with a slightly positive EBITDA, the firm's have a comfortable cash runway thanks to the firm's Series A funding of €12,000,000." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This financial stability allows the firm's to focus on delivering value to the client while maintaining the firm's target margins." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for cost-optimisation strategies, the firm's can propose using the sovereign tier with the sovereign European model, which is the most cost-efficient configuration on the recurring side. using would help in keeping the costs controlled and predictable, thus supporting the client's requirement for controlled annual operating costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, by favouring cost-efficient tiers and models, the firm's can protect the firm's gross margin and ensure the predictability of recurring costs, aligning with the firm's commercial posture." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, without exact figures on the specific costs associated with each component of this contract, the firm's aim to operate within the firm's target gross margin range of 25% to 35%, ensuring both the client's budget constraints are respected and the firm's financial goals are met." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires an artificial-intelligence assistance solution that improves productivity and the quality and reliability of work, while preserving professional secrecy and the reliability of figures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we design an AI component that meets these requirements, specifically req4 to req9, and taking into account con3 to con19?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision or sign-off may be automated.  3.4 Collaboration and mission continuity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet The client requirements, we can leverage we Atelier platform, which utilizes a retrieval-augmented generation approach, ensuring answers are grounded in validated material. leverage will help preserve professional secrecy and the reliability of figures as required by con3 and con4. we ai_llm_rag_capabilities include hybrid retrieval, re-ranking, query reformulation, multi-document synthesis, structured extraction with source linking, and template-guided drafting." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our ai_llm_rag_capabilities can support the design of an AI component that improves productivity and quality of work as needed for req4 to req9." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Specifically, we can use our Atelier platform, which utilizes a retrieval-augmented generation approach ability to provide contextualized answers grounded in cited sources (req22 and req23) and offer drafting assistance (req24) to improve productivity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The reliability of figures will be ensured by grounding figure-bearing statements in source documents and linking figure-bearing statements to figure-bearing statements source passages, as per we factual_reliability_of_figures principle." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address con3 to con19, we must ensure the solution remains a non-decisional support tool (con5), preserves professional secrecy and confidentiality (con20 and con21), and does not introduce rupture in working methods (con9). we approach of corpus curation with we experts and iterative methodologies will help integrate the AI component into existing practices without disrupting existing practices." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Moreover, we model selection principle allows we to choose between a sovereign European open-weight model or top-tier proprietary models, ensuring we can meet requirements related to sovereignty and data protection (con26 and con27)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Human oversight is built into we workflow, with professionals validating and signing off on deliverables (con33), maintaining professionals independence (con35) and upholding anti-money laundering obligations (con37)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Every interaction is logged for a posteriori audit, ensuring explainability and compliance with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk148> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging these capabilities and principles, we can design an AI component that meets the client's requirements while adhering to the specified constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk149> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The firm wishes to limit the environmental footprint of the solution and to rely, as far as possible, on low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must facilitate the continuity of missions between collaborators by enabling relevant information sharing, an understanding of the context of an in-progress client file, and an efficient resumption by another collaborator.  4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk150> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What sustainable practices can The firm propose to reduce our environmental impact, specifically con61, con62?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk151> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The firm can propose several sustainable practices to reduce our environmental impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk152> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, The firm green hosting partner, OuraneCloud, uses renewable energy and has a power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.2, which is relatively low." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk153> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our green hosting partner, OuraneCloud reuse heat, which further reduces our green hosting partner, OuraneCloud carbon footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk154> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The firm also practice digital sobriety through model right-sizing, caching, and batching, which helps to minimize the amount of energy consumed by The firm digital services." ;
